SUMMARY:Ein Team\, ein Plan und viele Agenten
LOCATION:Freiraum\, Zürcher Kantonalbank\, Bahnhofstrasse 9\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:A German-language breakfast session with Quatico CEO Jan Wloka 
 on why adding more AI agents tends to produce more review work than finish
 ed work\, and the three changes that fixed it for his team: a written deci
 sion before any agent starts coding\, work split into packages that run in
  parallel\, and one daily overview of what needs a human. Aimed at product
  owners and delivery leads\, with a real work package run live.\n\nOrganis
 er: Agile Breakfast Zürich (swissICT)\n\nDetails and registration: https:
 //swissdataevents.ch/events/agile-breakfast-zurich-viele-agenten-2026/
